---
title: Discord ingestion · deduplicate, debounce, seal, route
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant discord as Discord
  participant conn as Discord connector · worker process
  participant intake as Intake records
  participant router as Intake routing

  alt live gateway
    discord->>conn: message in a watched channel
    Note over conn: Drop the bot's own messages.
  else staff re-ingestion of a missed message
    Note over conn: Refuse an unwatched channel first.
    conn->>discord: fetch exactly that message
  end
  conn->>intake: receipt · author mapping · message ID deduplicates
  intake->>intake: open or extend the batch · one author, one channel
  loop until the quiet window passes
    discord->>conn: typing indicator · same author and channel
    conn->>intake: hold the open batch, never past its hard deadline
  end
  intake->>intake: seal one immutable Intake Item
  intake->>router: route the sealed batch
